# The CUDA template's unrecognised override word on the Device label, Windows 2026-11-28.
#
# The Vulkan template got this treatment on 2026-11-27 (vulkan-typo-label.log). The
# CUDA template reported an unrecognised OFXPLUGIN_GPU_MODE only through
# OFX::Log::print, which Resolve does not keep, and had no label parameter at all -
# so the typo was proven at the parser (execution_mode_test) and nowhere else.
#
# This run adds the channel and the assertion: a read-only `device` string parameter,
# written after every render with the mode, the reason, and the sentence a rejected
# word earns; and a contract run with OFXPLUGIN_GPU_MODE=gpux in its own process,
# one per template runner. The first attempt at the label wrote the plain CPU path's
# reason without the sentence - the check below failed with the label quoted back,
# which is what it is for.

